1
00:00:13,039 --> 00:00:16,719
So their so-called "benefiting patients worldwide"

2
00:00:18,199 --> 00:00:20,679
is just a scheme to swindle formulas from others

3
00:00:21,239 --> 00:00:24,160
and profit off patients with overpriced drugs.

4
00:00:27,960 --> 00:00:29,640
I won't let their scheme succeed.

5
00:00:35,880 --> 00:00:36,560
Hello, Senior Sister.

6
00:00:38,840 --> 00:00:39,719
I refuse to sign.

7
00:00:42,079 --> 00:00:43,159
Boss, what's wrong?

8
00:00:44,039 --> 00:00:45,560
Ren Feifan refused to sign.

9
00:00:46,600 --> 00:00:47,240
Looks like

10
00:00:48,280 --> 00:00:49,600
we'll have to play dirty.

11
00:00:49,880 --> 00:00:50,280
Understood.

12
00:01:00,840 --> 00:01:02,520
Junior Brother, still so cautious.

13
00:01:16,200 --> 00:01:17,599
Senior Sister, inviting me to dinner...

14
00:01:18,000 --> 00:01:19,480
I'm afraid it's not that simple.

15
00:01:19,840 --> 00:01:20,719
Just give it to me straight.

16
00:01:32,120 --> 00:01:34,560
Junior Brother, you're hurting me.

17
00:01:39,480 --> 00:01:39,959
Senior Sister,

18
00:01:41,319 --> 00:01:43,560
I don't know why you've suddenly become like this,

19
00:01:44,920 --> 00:01:46,079
but I really hope

20
00:01:47,519 --> 00:01:48,760
you won't sell yourself out.

21
00:01:59,400 --> 00:02:00,200
I drank the wine.

22
00:02:01,000 --> 00:02:02,120
I've given you your due respect.

23
00:02:02,840 --> 00:02:03,680
But as for the contract,

24
00:02:06,040 --> 00:02:07,200
I absolutely will not sign it.

25
00:02:16,360 --> 00:02:18,000
I knew seducing you wouldn't work.

26
00:02:18,719 --> 00:02:20,199
So this glass of wine

27
00:02:21,280 --> 00:02:22,840
is my real trick.

28
00:02:31,639 --> 00:02:32,199
Senior Sister,

29
00:02:33,759 --> 00:02:35,240
that wine represented our bond.

30
00:02:36,159 --> 00:02:38,000
If you'd even exploit that bond,

31
00:02:39,479 --> 00:02:41,479
then there's no need for us to meet again.

32
00:02:46,240 --> 00:02:46,879
Ren Feifan,

33
00:02:48,199 --> 00:02:49,240
you think that by refusing to sign,

34
00:02:49,599 --> 00:02:51,639
the Meniersen Group can't touch you?

35
00:02:52,960 --> 00:02:53,840
You'd better watch out.

36
00:02:54,520 --> 00:02:56,000
They won't let you off the hook.

37
00:02:56,000 --> 00:02:57,240
Then bring it on.

38
00:02:58,639 --> 00:02:59,080
You...

39
00:03:20,800 --> 00:03:22,039
A faint scent of mugwort...

40
00:03:23,439 --> 00:03:27,039
mixed with an alluring hint of powder.

41
00:03:30,199 --> 00:03:31,479
Your makeup today

42
00:03:32,680 --> 00:03:33,840
looks quite unique.

43
00:03:35,960 --> 00:03:37,919
Pretty girls have symmetrical faces.

44
00:03:37,919 --> 00:03:40,240
Mine's uneven, so this evens it out.

45
00:03:42,759 --> 00:03:44,560
Do both sides really have to match?

46
00:03:46,520 --> 00:03:47,280
As long as it's you,

47
00:03:48,479 --> 00:03:49,240
I love every part.

48
00:03:52,520 --> 00:03:55,280
So do you prefer this half of my face,

49
00:03:55,639 --> 00:03:57,039
or this half?

50
00:03:59,639 --> 00:04:01,080
Isn't that a no-win question?

51
00:04:01,080 --> 00:04:02,719
Come on, just pick one!

52
00:04:15,120 --> 00:04:16,439
Earlier, was Xinai Princess

53
00:04:16,439 --> 00:04:18,360
asking for our family's formula?

54
00:04:20,480 --> 00:04:21,720
Why are you suddenly asking that?

55
00:04:22,160 --> 00:04:23,120
Don't change the subject.

56
00:04:23,120 --> 00:04:24,160
I'm being serious.

57
00:04:24,480 --> 00:04:27,120
We can't just give the Ren family formula away.

58
00:04:28,279 --> 00:04:29,199
Yes, yes, yes.

59
00:04:30,879 --> 00:04:32,399
You're the lady of the Ren family.

60
00:04:33,120 --> 00:04:34,240
From now on, in Ren family matters,

61
00:04:35,199 --> 00:04:35,879
you have the final say.

62
00:04:52,040 --> 00:04:52,680
It's nothing serious.

63
00:04:53,079 --> 00:04:54,199
Just remember to take your meds on time.

64
00:04:54,600 --> 00:04:55,439
Pick up your medicine at the front.

65
00:04:55,439 --> 00:04:56,319
The front desk will give you the formula.

66
00:04:57,439 --> 00:04:58,160
Come, have a seat.

67
00:05:04,360 --> 00:05:05,639
A few more doses and you'll be fine.

68
00:05:06,360 --> 00:05:07,120
Same formula as before.

69
00:05:09,959 --> 00:05:10,600
Have some water.

70
00:05:11,360 --> 00:05:11,879
Thank you.

71
00:05:23,839 --> 00:05:24,360
Come out!

72
00:05:25,720 --> 00:05:26,399
Get out here!

73
00:05:28,519 --> 00:05:29,680
Hello, who are you?

74
00:05:30,079 --> 00:05:30,480
Get out!

75
00:05:31,360 --> 00:05:31,680
Move!

76
00:06:14,480 --> 00:06:15,399
If this keeps up,

77
00:06:15,800 --> 00:06:17,680
no one will dare come to Premier Medical Hall.

78
00:06:18,439 --> 00:06:19,519
Forget patients.

79
00:06:20,000 --> 00:06:21,360
We don't even have medicine now.

80
00:06:21,680 --> 00:06:22,959
I asked several suppliers.

81
00:06:23,240 --> 00:06:25,920
They all signed with the Meniersen Group.

82
00:06:26,360 --> 00:06:27,680
The contract stipulates

83
00:06:28,079 --> 00:06:29,680
they can't supply Premier Medical Hall.

84
00:06:30,560 --> 00:06:34,319
They're trying to drive us into the ground.

85
00:06:35,199 --> 00:06:36,000
I also heard

86
00:06:37,000 --> 00:06:38,360
it's not just Premier Medical Hall.

87
00:06:38,879 --> 00:06:40,959
Many clinics have been threatened too.

88
00:06:42,439 --> 00:06:42,800
No.

89
00:06:44,399 --> 00:06:45,839
I need to talk this over with Elder Lu.

90
00:06:46,240 --> 00:06:47,879
We can't let them destroy North City.

91
00:06:54,800 --> 00:06:55,240
Elder Lu,

92
00:06:55,800 --> 00:06:57,319
about what the Meniersen Group is doing...

93
00:06:57,319 --> 00:06:57,800
Junior Brother.

94
00:06:57,800 --> 00:06:58,600
Shouldn't we discuss

95
00:06:59,279 --> 00:07:00,879
whether our contract is still valid?

96
00:07:05,079 --> 00:07:07,120
Feifan, perfect timing.

97
00:07:07,720 --> 00:07:10,279
Xinai Princess is very interested in your formula.

98
00:07:10,519 --> 00:07:12,319
She's been wanting to talk with you.

99
00:07:12,480 --> 00:07:13,800
Since you called me,

100
00:07:14,120 --> 00:07:14,879
I was thinking

101
00:07:15,680 --> 00:07:17,040
I'd act as the middleman for you.

102
00:07:17,959 --> 00:07:18,439
Elder Lu,

103
00:07:19,079 --> 00:07:21,319
Meniersen Group is threatening clinics,

104
00:07:21,360 --> 00:07:22,680
forcing doctors to sell their formulas.

105
00:07:23,040 --> 00:07:24,120
Do you not know about this?

106
00:07:24,439 --> 00:07:25,279
I know.

107
00:07:26,639 --> 00:07:27,839
But what can be done?

108
00:07:29,319 --> 00:07:30,240
The Meniersen Group

109
00:07:30,240 --> 00:07:32,879
has cut off all clinics' herb supplies.

110
00:07:33,319 --> 00:07:35,759
North City patients all go to AI Medical.

111
00:07:36,959 --> 00:07:38,879
I could act righteous for my reputation,

112
00:07:38,879 --> 00:07:39,879
but what about those doctors?

113
00:07:40,160 --> 00:07:41,040
How will they survive?

114
00:07:42,120 --> 00:07:43,959
I'm considering the bigger picture,

115
00:07:44,680 --> 00:07:47,399
so North City's medical sector survives.

116
00:07:52,759 --> 00:07:54,079
Elder Lu is being kind.

117
00:07:54,319 --> 00:07:55,839
Afraid you'll get hurt, Junior Brother.

118
00:07:57,560 --> 00:07:59,120
There's news we haven't told you yet.

119
00:08:03,839 --> 00:08:04,279
Take a look.

120
00:08:05,360 --> 00:08:07,120
This is the deed to Premier Medical Hall.

121
00:08:09,879 --> 00:08:12,560
It now belongs to the Meniersen Group.

122
00:08:20,439 --> 00:08:22,639
Feifan, you should just sign.

123
00:08:23,199 --> 00:08:24,439
Otherwise, once we take the land,

124
00:08:24,680 --> 00:08:26,000
not only will Premier Medical Hall be gone,

125
00:08:26,279 --> 00:08:27,839
but you, Master, and Junior Sister

126
00:08:28,240 --> 00:08:29,639
won't even have a place to live.

127
00:08:31,120 --> 00:08:32,320
Master is getting old.

128
00:08:32,960 --> 00:08:34,360
Could he really bear that?

129
00:08:47,120 --> 00:08:47,759
Feifan.

130
00:08:48,080 --> 00:08:48,480
Yes.

131
00:08:48,759 --> 00:08:51,120
Premier Medical Hall is our family legacy.

132
00:08:51,720 --> 00:08:53,000
You must protect it.

133
00:08:53,000 --> 00:08:53,720
Yes.

134
00:08:54,480 --> 00:08:55,039
I know.

135
00:09:02,440 --> 00:09:02,720
Dad.

136
00:09:04,159 --> 00:09:04,440
Mom.

137
00:09:06,960 --> 00:09:09,120
I won't fail your trust.

138
00:09:11,759 --> 00:09:13,159
I'll restore Premier Medical Hall.

139
00:09:24,080 --> 00:09:25,200
You really do know

140
00:09:27,039 --> 00:09:28,720
what I care about most.

141
00:09:29,759 --> 00:09:33,279
It's the life's blood of the Ren family.

142
00:09:34,200 --> 00:09:35,480
If it's lost on your watch,

143
00:09:35,960 --> 00:09:37,120
can you bear the responsibility?

144
00:09:37,840 --> 00:09:40,080
All your efforts after leaving prison,

145
00:09:40,080 --> 00:09:40,919
wouldn't it all be wasted?

146
00:09:42,519 --> 00:09:43,200
Junior Brother,

147
00:09:44,279 --> 00:09:45,759
you'd better think this through.

148
00:09:58,360 --> 00:09:58,919
I'll sign.

149
00:10:04,720 --> 00:10:05,919
Boss, that Ren Feifan

150
00:10:05,919 --> 00:10:07,600
wants to wait for Live Contract Signing.

151
00:10:07,600 --> 00:10:08,840
Could there be something fishy going on?

152
00:10:09,960 --> 00:10:12,120
Would he bet Premier Medical Hall on this?

153
00:10:12,559 --> 00:10:13,679
He's out of options.

154
00:10:19,759 --> 00:10:21,159
Who said we're out of options?

155
00:10:23,120 --> 00:10:24,159
My path is wide open.

156
00:10:29,159 --> 00:10:29,799
What's this?

157
00:10:31,080 --> 00:10:32,279
How do they have your formula?

158
00:10:32,519 --> 00:10:33,879
Because I sent it to them, obviously.

159
00:10:34,639 --> 00:10:36,399
The Meniersen Group wants a patent, right?

160
00:10:37,679 --> 00:10:41,720
Can you patent a widely known formula?

161
00:10:41,720 --> 00:10:42,840
Ren Feifan, are you insane?

162
00:10:43,200 --> 00:10:44,559
You don't want Premier Medical Hall?

163
00:10:44,559 --> 00:10:45,840
I care about Premier Medical Hall,

164
00:10:46,679 --> 00:10:48,519
but I care more about medical ethics.

165
00:11:03,679 --> 00:11:04,399
Everyone online,

166
00:11:05,240 --> 00:11:05,559
this here

167
00:11:06,440 --> 00:11:07,879
is the Meniersen Group's contract.

168
00:11:10,120 --> 00:11:12,039
Hello everyone, my name is Ren Feifan.

169
00:11:12,440 --> 00:11:13,399
I'm a doctor at Premier Medical Hall.

170
00:11:14,679 --> 00:11:15,360
Look, look!

171
00:11:15,600 --> 00:11:17,080
Dr. Ren appeared in the livestream!

172
00:11:18,440 --> 00:11:19,960
During the recent epidemic in North City,

173
00:11:19,960 --> 00:11:21,919
the formula I developed could cure it.

174
00:11:22,600 --> 00:11:25,159
It caught the Meniersen Group's attention.

175
00:11:25,720 --> 00:11:26,600
They invited me

176
00:11:26,840 --> 00:11:27,960
to sell the formula at a high price,

177
00:11:27,960 --> 00:11:29,919
to their AI Medical system.

178
00:11:30,679 --> 00:11:31,320
I originally thought

179
00:11:31,720 --> 00:11:34,480
AI Medical was software to benefit all.

180
00:11:34,759 --> 00:11:35,679
Until I discovered

181
00:11:36,080 --> 00:11:37,559
their AI Medical system

182
00:11:37,840 --> 00:11:40,480
was just buying formulas to patent them,

183
00:11:40,480 --> 00:11:41,360
and sell medicine at outrageous prices,

184
00:11:41,799 --> 00:11:43,399
so patients who could afford treatment

185
00:11:43,759 --> 00:11:46,039
could no longer access better medication.

186
00:11:46,360 --> 00:11:47,840
This is something I cannot tolerate.

187
00:11:48,080 --> 00:11:48,519
So,

188
00:11:49,039 --> 00:11:51,639
I'd rather Premier Medical Hall be ruined

189
00:11:51,960 --> 00:11:53,600
than hide this formula from the public.

190
00:11:54,200 --> 00:11:56,399
I hope to awaken every patient and doctor

191
00:11:56,720 --> 00:11:59,279
to join me in resisting these profiteers

192
00:11:59,360 --> 00:12:01,399
who overcharge and exploit the sick.

193
00:12:01,720 --> 00:12:03,320
To restore integrity to the medical field,

194
00:12:03,960 --> 00:12:05,000
serving only the patients.

195
00:12:05,240 --> 00:12:07,360
Wow, Dr. Ren truly has a healer's heart!

196
00:12:07,399 --> 00:12:08,720
He's giving the formula to everyone!

197
00:12:09,000 --> 00:12:10,559
I'm never using Meniersen again.

198
00:12:10,840 --> 00:12:11,879
It's all a scam.

199
00:12:12,159 --> 00:12:13,639
These people have gone too far.

200
00:12:13,759 --> 00:12:15,360
Meniersen is truly inhuman.

201
00:12:15,679 --> 00:12:16,440
Dr. Ren is the real hero.

202
00:12:16,440 --> 00:12:17,879
He gave us the formula.

203
00:12:18,519 --> 00:12:19,039
Boss,

204
00:12:19,600 --> 00:12:22,120
Patients and netizens boycott AI Medical.

205
00:12:22,799 --> 00:12:23,960
The situation is escalating.

206
00:12:24,759 --> 00:12:27,039
Meniersen Group's stock has plummeted.

207
00:12:27,840 --> 00:12:31,080
HQ decided to return all formula patents

208
00:12:31,519 --> 00:12:32,480
and withdraw from the North City market.

209
00:12:34,320 --> 00:12:36,039
Ren Feifan!
